SUMMARY:R-Ladies Corvallis September Happy Hour - R-Ladies Corvallis
DESCRIPTION:**Join us for September's R-Ladies Corvallis Meet Up!** [R-Ladies](https://rladies.org/) is a worldwide organization whose mission is to promote gender diversity in the R community.\n\nThis is an informal event, held at Common Fields, for underrepresented minority genders in the R programming space (including but not limited to cis/trans women, trans men, non-binary, genderqueer, agender). We welcome seasoned, new, and aspiring R users.\nOur goals with R-Ladies Corvallis are to hold workshops, happy hours, networking opportunities, and more for our local R community. This meetup is simply an informal hang and chat with no official agenda.\n\nFood and drink are available for purchase. Please note this event will be held outside.\nThis is an open and informal event! Come as you are - any and all R skill level and experience welcome.
LOCATION:Common Fields, 545 SW 3rd Street, Corvallis, UNITED STATES OF AMERICA
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-corvallis/events/316420496/
ORGANIZER;CN=R-Ladies Corvallis:mailto:info@rladies.org
CATEGORIES:RLadies+,R-Ladies Corvallis
