SUMMARY:Posit Conf 2026 Watch Party - R-Ladies Vancouver
DESCRIPTION:Can't make it to the Posit Conference in Houston Texas? Come join us for a Posit Conf 2026 watch party! This is the premier event for the open-source data science community, focusing on the human ingenuity behind today's most powerful technical tools. This will feature talks in R, Python, and AI.\n\nMore information of the sessions are available here:\nhttps://conf.posit.co/2026/sessions/\nSchedule (Times are in CT which is 2 hours ahead)\nhttps://irp.cdn-website.com/d4d6e48c/files/uploaded/PST-Conf26-AgendaAtAGlance-preConf-v5.pdf\n\nWe will have Rladies Stickers and other Rstickers for participants!\n\nThe stream will be running from 7am - 3:15pm Pacific but we will be watching together from 9-3 on Tuesday and Wednesday so feel free to drop in at any time. Add when you will be there or see when other people are around here: [https://www.when2meet.com/?38365288-3SZic](https://www.when2meet.com/?38365288-3SZic)\n\n\*\*\*\n\n1. If this is your first R-Ladies event, please take a moment to review our R-Ladies Global code of conduct: [https://github.com/rladies/starter-kit/wiki/Code-of-Conduct](https://github.com/rladies/starter-kit/wiki/Code-of-Conduct)\n2. Who is this allowed to attend the event?\n\nEveryone is welcome to join us at our events and to be a part of our mission to empower gender minorities with the skills and knowledge to code in one of the top programming language in data science, which is R.\n3\. To fulfill this mission we do ask participants to respect a focus on the encouragement and support for women and non\-binary people during our events\.
LOCATION:UBC, 6359 Agronomy Road, UBC, Vancouver, CANADA
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-vancouver/events/316349468/
ORGANIZER;CN=R-Ladies Vancouver:mailto:info@rladies.org
CATEGORIES:RLadies+,R-Ladies Vancouver
